 <h3><u>Khoon me duba</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <div rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 20px; margin-right: margin-bottom: margin-left: line-height: 1.6em; cursor: text; > 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; >(Kya qayamat lab-e-alqama hai) x2<br> <br> Mashk chidi pani baha, ho gaye bazu kalam<br> Phool se Abbas ka, surkh huwa jab alam<br> Shor utha nehr par, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Shaad huwe ehl-e-shar, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are dekha suw-e-nehr to Shabbir ne rokar kaha<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Mei hu watan haa(n) yaha, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are kyu(n) na qamar ho kama, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are kyu na lahu ankho(n) se barsuo(n) bataa karbala<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Mojo(n) ne matam kiya, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are dasht se ayi sada, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are dekha suw-e-nehr to Zainab ko nazar agaya<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Lut gaya zehra ka cheyn, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are roke ye bole Hussain, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are meri Sakina ke liye hoga payaam-e-qaza<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Koyi nahi aasra, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are bhaayi akela huwa, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are sar se rida jayengi Zainab ko yaqee(n) hogaya<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Haath rakha qalb par, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are pheynki ridaa khaak par, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are ehl-e-haram saath huwe parhne lagi marsiya<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Toot gaya aasra, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are paani nahi ayenga, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are bhigi huwi ankho(n) se dekho to suw-e-alqama<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Kaise jiyungi bhala, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are mujhko na ayi qaza, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are aas meri toot gayi dekha jo mere khuda<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Nana ne nawha kiya, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are kehti hai maa sayyeda, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are dekh naya zakhm mere laal tujhe degaya<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x2</p> 
   <p><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Ab mera lashkar kaha, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Rone lagi alqama, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Khaymo(n) mei hai shor-o-sheyn, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Karti hai Zainab bukaa, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Fizza ne payi khabar, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Bacho(n) se sheh ne kaha, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Noha hai kulsoom ka, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> <span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Rote hai mushkil kusha, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br> Karta hai Mazhar buka, qatl-e-alamdar shud</p> 
   <p rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif, arial, verdana, 'trebuchet ms'; font-size: 13px; ><span 0, 0); font-family:times new roman; font-size:medium>Khaak urhaao zara, qatl-e-alamdar shud</span><br> Are nawha hai Irfaan ka, qatl-e-alamdar shud<br> Are peet'te hai sina-o-sar dekh ke ehl-e-aza<br> (Khoon mei duba alam Abbas ka, dekha to Shabbir ne rokar kaha) x3</p> 
